{"id":530,"root":"نيل","bw":"nyl","tr":"n-y-l","found":true,"html":"<div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\">  <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نَالَ مِنْهُ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span> <em>He defamed him.</em> (L, art. <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قبح</span>.) ― -b2- <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نَالَ مِنْ عِرْضِهِ</span> <em>He defamed him.</em> (T, K, TA.) ― -b3- <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نَال مِنْهُ</span> <em>He harmed, hurt,</em> or <em>injured him,</em> namely, an enemy. (Mgh.) ― -b4- <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نَالَهُ بِلِسَانِهِ</span> is coupled in the Msb, art. <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرص</span>, with <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَذَاهُ</span>; and seems plainly to signify <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَصاَبَهُ</span>, which, in this case, is the same as <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَذَاهُ</span>. And ↓ <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تَنَاوَلَهُ</span> has a similar meaning. ― -b5- <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نَالَ</span> <em>He obtained,</em> or <em>attained.</em> (S, K.) <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نَالَ مِنْ عَدُوِّهِ</span> <em>He attained</em> [or <em>obtained</em>] <em>the object of his aim,</em> or <em>desire, from his enemy.</em> (Msb.) ― -b6- <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نَالَهُ</span>, aor. <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يَنَالُ</span>, <em>It reached him; came to him;</em> syn. <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وَصَلَ اِلَيهِ</span>. (M, art. <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نيل</span>.) See also Bd, xxii. 38. ― -b7- <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نَالَ لَكَ أَنْ نَفْعَلَ</span>, aor. <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يَنِيلُ</span>; and <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لَكَ</span> ↓ <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَنَالَ</span>: see <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَنَى</span>. ― -b8- <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نَالَهُ</span>, first. pers. <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نِلْتَهُ</span>, inf. n. <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نَيلٌ</span>, <em>He obtained it; he attained it;</em> namely, the object of his wish, &amp;c. (S, K, Msb, &amp;c.) </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\">  <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَنْيَلَ</span> </span> see 1. </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\">  <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هُمَا يَتَنَايَلَانِ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> and <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يَتَنَاوَلاَنِ</span> </span> signify the same. (TA.) </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\"> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نَيلٌ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span> <em>Obtainment;</em> &amp;c.: see 1. </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\"> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اِنَانَةٌ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span> The act of <em>giving:</em> (PS in art. <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نيل</span>;) the <em>giving a gift.</em> (KL.) It seems properly to belong to art. <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نول</span>. </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\"> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نَيلٌ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span> (T, M, K) and ↓ <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نَايءِلٌ</span> (M, K) <em>What one obtains,</em> or <em>acquires,</em> (T, M, K,) <em>of the bounty of another;</em> like <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نَوَالَ</span>. (T.) </div>","pages":null,"shownPages":null,"chars":2229,"entries":6,"shownEntries":6,"truncated":false,"match":"direct","key":"nyl"}